<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title><%= appName || "LegalEase" %> - Consultation Confirmed</title>
  <style>
    body, p, h1, h2, h3, table, td {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      color: #1e293b;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #047857 100%);
      padding: 36px 36px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .badge-success {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      color: #a7f3d0;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header p {
      color: #d1fae5;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .paragraph {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #475569;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .summary-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .summary-header {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #334155;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .summary-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .summary-table td {
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    }
    .summary-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .summary-label {
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 500;
      width: 40%;
    }
    .summary-value {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .action-button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0 24px;
    }
    .action-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #047857;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
    }
    .notes-box {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #065f46;
    }
    .checklist {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .checklist h3 {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: #334155;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .checklist ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .checklist li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 24px 36px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #047857;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="badge-success">&#10003; Payment & Booking Confirmed</div>
        <h1><%= appName || "LegalEase" %></h1>
        <p>Consultation Appointment Confirmation</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p class="greeting">Hello <strong><%= clientName || "Client" %></strong>,</p>
        <p class="paragraph">
          Your payment has been successfully verified, and your legal consultation appointment has been scheduled with <strong>Adv. <%= lawyerName %></strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="summary-card">
          <div class="summary-header">Appointment Details</div>
          <table class="summary-table">
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Consultation ID:</td>
              <td class="summary-value" style="font-family: monospace;"><%= consultationId %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Legal Consultant:</td>
              <td class="summary-value">Adv. <%= lawyerName %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Scheduled Date:</td>
              <td class="summary-value"><%= appointmentDate %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Time Slot:</td>
              <td class="summary-value"><%= appointmentTime %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Session Type:</td>
              <td class="summary-value"><%= consultationType || "Standard Video Consultation (30 mins)" %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="summary-label">Fee Paid:</td>
              <td class="summary-value" style="color: #047857;"><%= amount %></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="action-button-container">
          <a href="<%= meetingLink || portalUrl %>" class="action-button" target="_blank">
            Access Consultation Room &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <% if (instructions) { %>
        <div class="notes-box">
          <strong>Consultant Note:</strong> <%= instructions %>
        </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="checklist">
          <h3>Preparation & Guidelines</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Please join the session 5-10 minutes early to test your audio and video connection.</li>
            <li>Upload any relevant case documents (PDFs) directly to your consultation portal ahead of time.</li>
            <li>Consultations are private and encrypted for client-attorney confidentiality.</li>
            <li>Need to reschedule or cancel? You can manage your appointment from your client dashboard.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Thank you for choosing <%= appName || "LegalEase" %> Bangladesh.</p>
        <p>Questions? Contact client support at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail || 'support@legalease.com' %>"><%= supportEmail || "support@legalease.com" %></a>.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= appName || "LegalEase" %>. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
